 *   CR0 CR0 CR0 CR4     CR4      XCR0 XCR0 FCW                      MXCSR
 *   MP, EM, TS, OSFXSR, OSXSAVE, SSE, AVX, ES+, fAligned, AC/AM,   MM,   bXcptMmx,    bXcptSse,    bXcptAvx */
